From 1033b8ad35fce24e5c48f343cc92033fa69b6e6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:07:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Drop BuildRequires: gnupg2

The source signature check was removed in 48e8933 (rhbz#2571543), and
nothing else in the build uses GnuPG, so the package no longer needs it.
This also removes dhcp from the packages that require GnuPG to build,
which matters for ELN, where %gpgverify and GnuPG-based checks are
being phased out.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 dhcp.spec | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dhcp.spec b/dhcp.spec
index ece508f..c713e01 100644
--- a/dhcp.spec
+++ b/dhcp.spec
@@ -96,7 +96,6 @@ BuildRequires: libcap-ng-devel
 BuildRequires: systemd systemd-devel
 # dhcp-sd_notify.patch
 BuildRequires: pkgconfig(libsystemd)
-BuildRequires: gnupg2
 %if ! 0%{?_module_build}
 BuildRequires: doxygen
 %endif
-- 
2.56.1

